      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "30",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The word that came to Jeremiah from the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.30.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.30.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", saying,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thus speaketh the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.30.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.30.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God of Israel, saying, Write thee all the words that I have spoken unto thee in a book.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For, lo, the days come, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.30.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.30.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", that I will bring again the captivity of my people Israel and Judah, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.30.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.30.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ": and I will cause them to return to the land that I gave to their fathers, and they shall possess it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And these",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.30.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.30.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the words that the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.30.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.30.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "spake concerning Israel and concerning Judah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For thus saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.30.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.30.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; We have heard a voice of trembling, of fear, and not of peace.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ask ye now, and see whether a man doth travail with child? wherefore do I see every man with his hands on his loins, as a woman in travail, and all faces are turned into paleness?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alas! for that day",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.30.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.30.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "great, so that none",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.30.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.30.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "like it: it",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.30.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.30.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "even the time of Jacob's trouble; but he shall be saved out of it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For it shall come to pass in that day, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.30.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.30.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of hosts,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.30.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.30.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will break his yoke from off thy neck, and will burst thy bonds, and strangers shall no more serve themselves of him:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But they shall serve the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.30.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.30.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "their God, and David their king, whom I will raise up unto them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Therefore fear thou not, O my servant Jacob, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.30.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.30.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; neither be dismayed, O Israel: for, lo, I will save thee from afar, and thy seed from the land of their captivity; and Jacob shall return, and shall be in rest, and be quiet, and none shall make",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "him",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.30.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.30.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "afraid.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.30.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.30.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with thee, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.30.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.30.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", to save thee: though I make a full end of all nations whither I have scattered thee, yet will I not make a full end of thee: but I will correct thee in measure, and will not leave thee altogether unpunished.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For thus saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.30.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.30.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", Thy bruise",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.30.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.30.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "incurable,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.30.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.30.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thy wound",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.30.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.30.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "grievous.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "There is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.30.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.30.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "none to plead thy cause, that thou mayest be bound up: thou hast no healing medicines.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All thy lovers have forgotten thee; they seek thee not; for I have wounded thee with the wound of an enemy, with the chastisement of a cruel one, for the multitude of thine iniquity;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "because",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.30.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.30.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thy sins were increased.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Why criest thou for thine affliction? thy sorrow",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.30.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.30.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "incurable for the multitude of thine iniquity:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "because",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.30.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.30.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thy sins were increased, I have done these things unto thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore all they that devour thee shall be devoured; and all thine adversaries, every one of them, shall go into captivity; and they that spoil thee shall be a spoil, and all that prey upon thee will I give for a prey.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For I will restore health unto thee, and I will heal thee of thy wounds, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.30.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.30.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; because they called thee an Outcast,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "saying",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.30.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.30.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", This",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.30.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.30.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zion, whom no man seeketh after.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Thus saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.30.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.30.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; Behold, I will bring again the captivity of Jacob's tents, and have mercy on his dwellingplaces; and the city shall be builded upon her own heap, and the palace shall remain after the manner thereof.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And out of them shall proceed thanksgiving and the voice of them that make merry: and I will multiply them, and they shall not be few; I will also glorify them, and they shall not be small.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Their children also shall be as aforetime, and their congregation shall be established before me, and I will punish all that oppress them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And their nobles shall be of themselves, and their governor shall proceed from the midst of them; and I will cause him to draw near, and he shall approach unto me: for who",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.30.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.30.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "this that engaged his heart to approach unto me? saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.30.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.30.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And ye shall be my people, and I will be your God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, the whirlwind of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.30.23",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.30.23"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "goeth forth with fury, a continuing whirlwind: it shall fall with pain upon the head of the wicked.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The fierce anger of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.30.24",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.30.24"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall not return, until he have done",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.30.24",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.30.24"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and until he have performed the intents of his heart: in the latter days ye shall consider it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
